## TRAINING DATA — CẬP NHẬT CHO MULTI-AGENT

Cần tổng **~1,400 samples** (thêm 200 so với single agent plan):

| Skill type | Số lượng | Mục đích |
|---|---|---|
| text-to-sql | 600 | SQL Agent training |
| data-analysis (pandas) | 400 | Python Agent training |
| supervisor-routing | 200 | Supervisor ExecutionPlan generation |
| insight-generation | 150 | Insight Agent training |
| error-reflection | 100 | Reflector Agent training |

**Supervisor routing samples** có format đặc biệt:
```json
{
  "messages": [
    {"role": "system", "content": "<SUPERVISOR_SYSTEM_PROMPT với info_box>"},
    {"role": "user", "content": "So sánh doanh thu Q4-2024 vs Q4-2023 theo region"},
    {"role": "assistant", "content": "{\"plan_summary\": \"...\", \"steps\": [{\"step\": 1, \"agent\": \"sql\", ...}]}"}
  ]
}
```

### MLX-LM Training Config (M2 local)

```yaml
# training/mlx_config.yaml
model: mlx-community/Qwen2.5-Coder-7B-Instruct-4bit
train: true
data: data/                          # thư mục chứa train.jsonl, valid.jsonl
lora_layers: 16
batch_size: 2
iters: 1200                          # ~3 epochs với 960 samples, batch 2
val_batches: 25
learning_rate: 2e-4
steps_per_report: 50
steps_per_eval: 200
save_every: 200
adapter_path: adapters/
max_seq_length: 2048
train_on_completion_only: true       # Loss chỉ trên assistant tokens — implement L=Σlog P(aₜ|q,sₜ,a<ₜ)
```

**Chạy training:** `python -m mlx_lm.lora --config training/mlx_config.yaml`

